        ['Given P = 9.1 × 10³ and Q = 7 × 10⁵, (a) find P × Q in standard form, (b) find P ÷ Q in standard form, giving the number part to 3 significant figures. Show your working.', ['Multiply number parts and add powers', 'P × Q = 6.37 × 10⁹', 'Divide number parts and subtract powers', 'P ÷ Q = 1.3 × 10⁻²'], '(a) P × Q = (9.1 × 7) × 10^(3 + 5) = 63.7 × 10^8 = 6.37 × 10⁹. (b) P ÷ Q = (9.1 ÷ 7) × 10^(3 − 5) = 1.3 × 10⁻².', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
        ['Given P = 1.4 × 10³ and Q = 3.1 × 10⁴, (a) find P × Q in standard form, (b) find P ÷ Q in standard form, giving the number part to 3 significant figures. Show your working.', ['Multiply number parts and add powers', 'P × Q = 4.34 × 10⁷', 'Divide number parts and subtract powers', 'P ÷ Q = 4.52 × 10⁻²'], '(a) P × Q = (1.4 × 3.1) × 10^(3 + 4) = 4.34 × 10^7 = 4.34 × 10⁷. (b) P ÷ Q = (1.4 ÷ 3.1) × 10^(3 − 4) = 4.52 × 10⁻².', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
        ['Given P = 7.5 × 10³ and Q = 4.1 × 10², (a) find P × Q in standard form, (b) find P ÷ Q in standard form, giving the number part to 3 significant figures. Show your working.', ['Multiply number parts and add powers', 'P × Q = 3.08 × 10⁶', 'Divide number parts and subtract powers', 'P ÷ Q = 1.83 × 10¹'], '(a) P × Q = (7.5 × 4.1) × 10^(3 + 2) = 30.75 × 10^5 = 3.08 × 10⁶. (b) P ÷ Q = (7.5 ÷ 4.1) × 10^(3 − 2) = 1.83 × 10¹.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
        ['Given P = 1.2 × 10⁵ and Q = 5.8 × 10⁴, (a) find P × Q in standard form, (b) find P ÷ Q in standard form, giving the number part to 3 significant figures. Show your working.', ['Multiply number parts and add powers', 'P × Q = 6.96 × 10⁹', 'Divide number parts and subtract powers', 'P ÷ Q = 2.07 × 10⁰'], '(a) P × Q = (1.2 × 5.8) × 10^(5 + 4) = 6.96 × 10^9 = 6.96 × 10⁹. (b) P ÷ Q = (1.2 ÷ 5.8) × 10^(5 − 4) = 2.07 × 10⁰.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
        ['Given P = 1.8 × 10³ and Q = 8.2 × 10², (a) find P × Q in standard form, (b) find P ÷ Q in standard form, giving the number part to 3 significant figures. Show your working.', ['Multiply number parts and add powers', 'P × Q = 1.48 × 10⁶', 'Divide number parts and subtract powers', 'P ÷ Q = 2.2 × 10⁰'], '(a) P × Q = (1.8 × 8.2) × 10^(3 + 2) = 14.76 × 10^5 = 1.48 × 10⁶. (b) P ÷ Q = (1.8 ÷ 8.2) × 10^(3 − 2) = 2.2 × 10⁰.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
