        ['The points A(2, −2) and B(−4, −4) are given. (a) Find the vector AB. (b) Find |AB|, correct to 2 decimal places. (c) Find the coordinates of the midpoint M of AB.', ['AB = (−6, −2)', 'Magnitude 6.32', 'Midpoint (−1, −3)'], '(a) AB = B − A = (−6, −2). (b) |AB| = √((−6)² + (−2)²) = 6.32. (c) M = (−1, −3).', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 6],
