        ['The favourite foods of 40 pupils were: rice 5, banku 11, kenkey 7, yam 17. (a) Calculate the angle of each sector of a pie chart. (b) Draw the pie chart. (c) What percentage of the pupils chose rice?', ['Degrees per pupil', 'Four correct angles', 'Pie chart drawn', 'Percentage 12.5%'], '(a) Each pupil = 360 ÷ 40 = 9°. Angles: rice 45°, banku 99°, kenkey 63°, yam 153°. (b) Draw a circle and the sectors with a protractor. (c) 5 ÷ 40 × 100 = 12.5%.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 8],
        ['The favourite foods of 72 pupils were: rice 22, banku 16, kenkey 21, yam 13. (a) Calculate the angle of each sector of a pie chart. (b) Draw the pie chart. (c) What percentage of the pupils chose rice?', ['Degrees per pupil', 'Four correct angles', 'Pie chart drawn', 'Percentage 30.6%'], '(a) Each pupil = 360 ÷ 72 = 5°. Angles: rice 110°, banku 80°, kenkey 105°, yam 65°. (b) Draw a circle and the sectors with a protractor. (c) 22 ÷ 72 × 100 = 30.6%.', 'Compare your answer with the model answer and tick off the points you made.', 4, 'theory', 8],
